

#  💍 LOTR Character Recommender

###  Character Recommendation System Based on Dialogue Similarity

A Natural Language Processing (NLP) project that recommends **Lord of the Rings characters based on dialogue similarity**. The application allows users to select any dialogue and discover the Top 5 characters whose dialogues are most similar to the selected text.

---

##  Project Overview

The LOTR Character Recommender uses **TF-IDF Vectorization** and **Cosine Similarity** to analyze dialogue from *The Lord of the Rings* and recommend similar characters.

The project includes an interactive Streamlit web application where users can:

- Select a dialogue from a dropdown menu.
- Click the **Recommend Characters** button.
- Get the Top 5 recommended characters based on dialogue similarity.
- Search dialogues using specific keywords.
- Explore character dialogue data interactively.

> **Note:** Recommendations are based on textual similarity, not actual character relationships, friendship, or personality.

---
##  Dataset Source

The dataset used in this project was sourced from Kaggle.

- **Platform:** Kaggle
- **Dataset:** Lord of the Rings (LOTR) Scripts and Characters
- **Source:** [Kaggle – Search LOTR Datasets]( https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/paultimothymooney/lord-of-the-rings-data)

The dataset contains character information and dialogue from *The Lord of the Rings*, which was used for data preprocessing, text analysis, and building the character recommendation system.

### Dataset Files

- `lotr_scripts.csv` – Original dialogue dataset
- `lotr_characters.csv` – Character information
- `movies.pkl` – Processed dataset used by the Streamlit application

**Note:** Dataset credit belongs to the original Kaggle dataset creator. Please refer to the original dataset page for licensing and attribution requirements.

